      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "deferredOperation is optional and only applies to copy from:\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n\ndevice only populated if copy from:\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR \notherwise device used by commandBuffer should be referenced\n\ncommandBufferRecordingId only populated if copy from:\n    VkCmdCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCmdCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCmdCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n\nsrc/dst values can be null depending on the type of copy:\nVk(Cmd)CopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    srcAccelerationStructure will be populated\n    dstAccelerationStructure will be populated\nVk(Cmd)CopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    srcAccelerationStructure will be populated\n    dstAddress will be populated\nVk(Cmd)CopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n    srcAddress will be populated\n    dstAccelerationStructure will be populated",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "smrTTlpT-cDl5tTDSKVQI",
      "originalText": "deferredOperation is optional and only applies to copy from:\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n\ndevice only populated if copy from:\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR \notherwise device used by commandBuffer should be referenced\n\ncommandBufferRecordingId only populated if copy from:\n    VkCmdCopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    VkCmdCopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    VkCmdCopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n\nsrc/dst values can be null depending on the type of copy:\nVk(Cmd)CopyAccelerationStructureKHR\n    srcAccelerationStructure will be populated\n    dstAccelerationStructure will be populated\nVk(Cmd)CopyAccelerationStructureToMemoryKHR\n    srcAccelerationStructure will be populated\n    dstAddress will be populated\nVk(Cmd)CopyMemoryToAccelerationStructureKHR\n    srcAddress will be populated\n    dstAccelerationStructure will be populated",
